\b FINALPINGAPP PRIVACY POLICY\b0\par
\par
Last Updated: May 12, 2026\par
\par
FinalPingApp ("we," "us," or "our") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you use FinalPing, how we use and share it, how long we keep it, and the rights available to you. By using FinalPing, you agree to the practices described in this policy.\par
\par
\b 1. WHO WE ARE\b0\par
\par
FinalPingApp is a sole proprietorship operating the FinalPing aircraft tracking desktop application and associated web services at finalpingapp.com. For privacy inquiries, you may contact us at aircraftalerts@finalpingapp.com.\par
\par
\b 2. INFORMATION WE COLLECT\b0\par
\par
\b Account Information.\b0  When you create an account or activate FinalPing, we collect your email address, a hashed password, license key, and the date and time of activation. If you enable two-factor authentication, we store your 2FA method preference and a hashed verification token.\par
\par
\b Configuration Data.\b0  To deliver the tracking service, we store: aircraft tail numbers and ICAO24 hex codes you choose to monitor, your tracking location coordinates and airport code, detection radius and polling interval settings, quiet hours preferences, alert distance thresholds, webhook URLs (Discord, Slack, Teams, custom HTTPS endpoints), and Twilio SMS credentials you optionally provide.\par
\par
\b Alert and Log Data.\b0  We store a history of alert notifications generated by your account, including timestamp, aircraft identifier, alert type, integration type, delivery status, and the alert message. This data is used to populate your alert history dashboard and export features.\par
\par
\b Technical and Device Data.\b0  We may collect application version numbers, general error and diagnostic logs, and aggregated usage analytics (via PostHog) to improve the Software. PostHog analytics data is anonymized and does not identify you personally.\par
\par
\b Support Communications.\b0  If you contact us through the contact form or by email, we retain the content of those communications to respond to your request.\par
\par
\b 3. INFORMATION WE DO NOT COLLECT\b0\par
\par
- Your name or physical address\par
- Payment card numbers or banking information (processed by Stripe; we never see your card details)\par
- Browsing history or behavior outside the FinalPing application and website\par
- The content of messages delivered to your configured webhooks or SMS integrations\par
- Real-time location data about you personally\par
- Any data from aircraft beyond what you explicitly configure\par
\par
\b 4. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION\b0\par
\par
We use the information we collect to:\par
\par
- Authenticate your license and provide access to the Software\par
- Sync your configuration across authorized devices\par
- Deliver aircraft proximity notifications to your configured integrations\par
- Maintain your alert history and make it accessible through your account dashboard\par
- Send transactional emails, including license delivery, renewal confirmations, and account security notices\par
- Respond to support requests and contact form submissions\par
- Detect and prevent fraud, abuse, and unauthorized access\par
- Improve, maintain, and develop the Software and related services\par
- Comply with legal obligations\par
\par
We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing or advertising purposes.\par
\par
\b 5. LEGAL BASIS FOR PROCESSING (GDPR)\b0\par
\par
If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA) or United Kingdom, our legal basis for processing your personal data is:\par
\par
- Performance of a contract: Processing necessary to deliver the Software and services you purchased\par
- Legitimate interests: Fraud prevention, security, product improvement, and support communications\par
- Legal obligation: Compliance with applicable laws and regulations\par
- Consent: Where you have given explicit consent (for example, optional analytics participation)\par
\par
\b 6. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES\b0\par
\par
\b ADS-B Data Providers.\b0  FinalPing uses publicly available ADS-B flight data from third-party providers such as adsb.lol and ADS-B Exchange. Your tracking location coordinates are transmitted to these providers as part of API requests to retrieve nearby aircraft data. These providers operate independently and have their own privacy policies.\par
\par
\b Stripe.\b0  License purchases and subscription billing are processed by Stripe, Inc. FinalPingApp does not store payment card information. Stripe acts as an independent data controller for payment data. Stripe's privacy policy is available at stripe.com/privacy.\par
\par
\b Resend.\b0  We use Resend to send transactional and account-related emails. Only your email address and the content of the specific email are shared with Resend. Resend's privacy policy is available at resend.com/legal/privacy-policy.\par
\par
\b Railway.\b0  Our backend infrastructure is hosted on Railway (railway.app). Your configuration and account data are stored on Railway servers. Railway's privacy policy is available at railway.app/legal/privacy.\par
\par
\b PostHog.\b0  We use PostHog for anonymized product analytics on the FinalPing website. PostHog does not receive personally identifiable information. PostHog's privacy policy is available at posthog.com/privacy.\par
\par
\b Twilio.\b0  If you configure SMS alerts, Twilio processes and delivers SMS messages to the phone number you provide. FinalPingApp does not store the content of SMS messages after delivery. Twilio's privacy policy is available at twilio.com/legal/privacy.\par
\par
\b Webhooks and Integrations.\b0  When an alert is triggered, FinalPing sends a notification payload to the webhook URL(s) you configure (Discord, Slack, Teams, custom HTTPS). FinalPingApp does not store the content of webhook deliveries after transmission. You are responsible for the privacy and security of any endpoint you configure.\par
\par
\b 7. COOKIES AND TRACKING\b0\par
\par
The FinalPing website uses cookies and similar technologies to maintain your authenticated session, remember your preferences, and support anonymized analytics (PostHog). You may control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling session cookies will prevent you from logging in to your account dashboard.\par
\par
\b 8. DATA STORAGE AND SECURITY\b0\par
\par
Your account and configuration data are stored on servers hosted by Railway. Authentication tokens on your device are stored in encrypted application storage. We implement industry-standard technical and organizational measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction, including encrypted connections (HTTPS/TLS), hashed password storage, and access controls.\par
\par
No method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. While we take reasonable precautions, we cannot guarantee absolute security.\par
\par
\b 9. DATA RETENTION\b0\par
\par
We retain your account and configuration data for as long as your account remains active or as needed to provide the service. Alert history logs are retained for up to 12 months. If you request deletion of your account, we will delete or anonymize your personal data within 30 days, except where retention is required by law (for example, financial records related to billing may be retained for up to 7 years).\par
\par
\b 10. YOUR RIGHTS\b0\par
\par
Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:\par
\par
- Access: Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you\par
- Correction: Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data\par
- Deletion: Request deletion of your personal data ("right to be forgotten")\par
- Restriction: Request that we restrict processing of your data\par
- Portability: Receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format\par
- Objection: Object to processing based on legitimate interests\par
- Withdrawal of consent: Withdraw consent at any time where processing is based on consent\par
\par
To exercise any of these rights, contact us at aircraftalerts@finalpingapp.com. We will respond within 30 days. We may need to verify your identity before fulfilling a request.\par
\par
